{"id":"c04baacf4202d9f7","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-complete-system.md","title":"Complete System","display":"df-complete-system — Complete System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-complete-system","aliases":["92-df-complete-system"],"display":"df-complete-system — Complete System","depends_on":["[[92-df-formal-system]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-sentence]]"],"source":"第 V–VI 章 pp. 60–63、79–82；本地同语言系统族的定义","source_status":"原书否定完备性的本地实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-complete-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-complete-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complete-system — Complete System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V–VI 章 pp. 60–63、79–82；本地同语言系统族的定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书否定完备性的本地实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\">\\(\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\\)</span> 是本地算术语言上的形式系统；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，规则只在本地公式之间推理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 分别见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> 为定义目标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(\\mathcal F\\vdash\\varphi\\lor\\mathcal F\\vdash\\neg\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(\\mathcal F\\vdash\\varphi\\lor\\mathcal F\\vdash\\neg\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是同语言系统族上的否定完备性，适用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>、其同语言扩展和规范理论呈现。它不是一阶演算对所有模型的语义完备性。\n相容并且定理可有效枚举时，并行搜索句子及其否定的证明可以决定句子可证性；完备性本身不提供有效枚举器。不完备性结论仍需相容、有效公理化和足够算术强度。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1f