5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-universal-closure]]把本地 PA 的开放参数公理转换为闭句集；[[92-df-consistent]]、[[92-df-complete-system]]与[[92-df-theory-set]]在相同算术签名下接受一般形式系统。"},{"id":"ea730faf0a9f37d4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38545b094b915076","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f9f1d74ed907c53b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"52184c84df392b80","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Complete}$ (completeness predicate, see [[92-df-complete-system]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-system]]"}],"outgoing":["6a1ff87567369c3c","d666a3e3ee6c8148","5a1bd470754681a7","51c43e0240787ebb","90f32e29c9d553ed"]}